      "locked": false,
      "text": "OIDC - OpenIdConnect\nIssues ID Tokens\n(Authentication)/\n- Identity layer built\non top of OAuth 2.0.\n- OIDC → Proof of user\nauthentication and\nidentity.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "VDP3jvRtk8e8BZMyRCwFH",
      "originalText": "OIDC - OpenIdConnect\nIssues ID Tokens (Authentication)/\n- Identity layer built on top of OAuth 2.0.\n- OIDC → Proof of user authentication and identity.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7MwuQuR2xshAedVUBvfJM",
