    {
      "id": "pZmH1OxEJLWfQbFKvoxFr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 261.6657995847379,
      "y": -1081.738152753307,
      "width": 572,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 30,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aLV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 601683202,
      "version": 904,
      "versionNonce": 2020693690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795253545940,
      "created": 1794578076980,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Header\n{\n  \"alg\": \"RS256\",\n  \"typ\": \"JWT\"\n}\n\nPayload\n{\n  \"sub\": \"user-123\",\n  \"name\": \"Abhishek\",\n  \"role\": \"USER\",\n  \"iss\": \"https://auth.example.com\",\n  \"aud\": \"ecommerce-api\",\n  \"iat\": 1793600000,\n  \"exp\": 1793603600,\n  \"scope\": \"orders:read orders:write\"\n}\n\nField        Meaning\nsub        Subject — the user ID\niss        Issuer — who created the token\naud        Audience — which API/service the token is\nintended for\nscope        Permissions granted\nexp        Expiration time\n\nKeycloak signs the encoded header and payload:\nSignature = RS256(\n    Base64URL(Header) + \".\" + Base64URL(Payload),\n    PrivateKey\n)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "7MwuQuR2xshAedVUBvfJM",
      "originalText": "Header\n{\n  \"alg\": \"RS256\",\n  \"typ\": \"JWT\"\n}\n\nPayload\n{\n  \"sub\": \"user-123\",\n  \"name\": \"Abhishek\",\n  \"role\": \"USER\",\n  \"iss\": \"https://auth.example.com\",\n  \"aud\": \"ecommerce-api\",\n  \"iat\": 1793600000,\n  \"exp\": 1793603600,\n  \"scope\": \"orders:read orders:write\"\n}\n\nField        Meaning\nsub        Subject — the user ID\niss        Issuer — who created the token\naud        Audience — which API/service the token is intended for\nscope        Permissions granted\nexp        Expiration time\n\nKeycloak signs the encoded header and payload:\nSignature = RS256(\n    Base64URL(Header) + \".\" + Base64URL(Payload),\n    PrivateKey\n)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
