      "locked": false,
      "text": "API G/W\n- Validates the token, signature,\nexpiry and relevant claims.\n- SSL/TLS Termination (Even AEAD is\nTerminated with TLS)\n- TLS -> Transport Layer Security -\nprotects data in transit and verifies\nservers identity using digital cert",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lnI-mZZLMIOGQbTWiW6CM",
      "originalText": "API G/W\n- Validates the token, signature, expiry and relevant claims.\n- SSL/TLS Termination (Even AEAD is Terminated with TLS)\n- TLS -> Transport Layer Security - protects data in transit and verifies servers identity using digital cert",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
