      "text": "Gateway: Is this user authenticated\nand allowed to access /orders?\n\nOrder Service: Does this user have\npermission to view this particular\norder? AUD: orders-api",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "k3HIqarrobeHzBqoSnm1F",
      "originalText": "Gateway: Is this user authenticated and allowed to access /orders?\n\nOrder Service: Does this user have permission to view this particular order? AUD: orders-api",
